doctype html
html(lang='en')

    head
        meta(charset='utf-8')
        meta(name='viewport', content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1')
        meta(name='description', content='A real-world strawberry dataset for object detection, keypoint estimation, ripeness classification, and occlusion reasoning.')
        meta(name='theme-color', content='#17364d')
        meta(property='og:type', content='website')
        meta(property='og:title', content='Strawberry Dataset')
        meta(property='og:description', content='A research dataset with bounding boxes, five keypoints, ripeness labels, and occlusion labels.')
        meta(property='og:url', content='https://strawberry-vision-dataset.yuhao-jin.chatgpt.site/')
        meta(property='og:image', content='https://strawberry-vision-dataset.yuhao-jin.chatgpt.site/assets/og-strawberry-dataset.jpg')
        meta(name='twitter:card', content='summary_large_image')
        title Strawberry Dataset | Agricultural Computer Vision

        link(rel='canonical', href='https://strawberry-vision-dataset.yuhao-jin.chatgpt.site/')
        link(rel='icon', type='image/png', href='assets/strawberry-favicon.png')
        include includes/css.pug

    body
        a.skip-link(href='#main-content') Skip to content

        include includes/navbar.pug

        main#main-content
            header#overview.research-hero
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .project-label Dataset project page
                    .row.g-5.align-items-start
                        .col-lg-7
                            h1 A real-world strawberry dataset for detection and keypoint estimation
                            p.hero-abstract
                                | This dataset provides instance-level annotations for strawberries captured in greenhouse environments. Each annotated fruit combines a bounding box, five anatomical keypoints, a ripeness label, and an occlusion label.
                            .hero-actions
                                a.btn.btn-research(href='https://pan.baidu.com/s/1ul6L7jNT5VSTEdgTZroezA?pwd=pgna', target='_blank', rel='noopener noreferrer') Download dataset
                                a.btn.btn-outline-research(href='#protocol') Read annotation protocol
                            dl.project-metadata
                                .metadata-row
                                    dt Research tasks
                                    dd Object detection · Keypoint estimation · Attribute recognition
                                .metadata-row
                                    dt Annotation unit
                                    dd Individual strawberry instance
                                .metadata-row
                                    dt Capture domain
                                    dd Real greenhouse scenes
                                .metadata-row
                                    dt Dataset access
                                    dd Public download link
                        .col-lg-5
                            figure.research-figure.hero-figure
                                .figure-frame
                                    img(src='assets/strawberry-field.webp', alt='Strawberries growing in a greenhouse with an illustrative instance annotation', width='1280', height='720', fetchpriority='high')
                                    .scientific-box(aria-hidden='true')
                                        span bbox
                                    span.scientific-point.scientific-point--1(aria-hidden='true')
                                    span.scientific-point.scientific-point--2(aria-hidden='true')
                                    span.scientific-point.scientific-point--3(aria-hidden='true')
                                    span.scientific-point.scientific-point--4(aria-hidden='true')
                                    span.scientific-point.scientific-point--5(aria-hidden='true')
                                figcaption
                                    span.figure-number Figure 1.
                                    |  Example greenhouse image with an illustrative bounding box and five landmark points.

            section#abstract.paper-section
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .section-heading
                        span.section-number 01
                        div
                            p.section-type Overview
                            h2 Abstract
                    .abstract-layout
                        .abstract-text
                            p
                                | Strawberry perception in field conditions is complicated by foliage, uneven illumination, overlapping fruit, maturity variation, and partial visibility. These conditions are retained in the dataset so that models can be studied under realistic visual complexity.
                            p
                                | The annotation structure supports several related computer-vision tasks within one instance record. Bounding boxes define object extent, five keypoints encode landmark geometry, and two categorical attributes describe ripeness and occlusion.
                        aside.contribution-panel(aria-labelledby='contribution-title')
                            h3#contribution-title Dataset scope
                            ul
                                li Real greenhouse imagery rather than isolated objects
                                li Instance localization and landmark supervision
                                li Ripeness and visibility attributes
                                li Suitable for multi-task agricultural perception studies

            section#protocol.paper-section.paper-section--alt
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .section-heading
                        span.section-number 02
                        div
                            p.section-type Method
                            h2 Annotation protocol
                    p.section-summary
                        | Each strawberry instance is represented by a compact set of spatial and categorical annotations. The table summarizes the public schema without inferring unpublished dataset statistics.
                    .table-responsive.protocol-table-wrap
                        table.protocol-table
                            thead
                                tr
                                    th(scope='col') Signal
                                    th(scope='col') Representation
                                    th(scope='col') Intended use
                                    th(scope='col') Per instance
                            tbody
                                tr
                                    th(scope='row') Localization
                                    td Axis-aligned bounding box
                                    td Object detection and instance localization
                                    td 1 box
                                tr
                                    th(scope='row') Geometry
                                    td Anatomical landmark coordinates
                                    td Keypoint estimation and shape reasoning
                                    td 5 points
                                tr
                                    th(scope='row') Ripeness
                                    td Categorical maturity label
                                    td Visual grading and attribute recognition
                                    td 1 label
                                tr
                                    th(scope='row') Occlusion
                                    td Categorical visibility label
                                    td Robustness analysis under partial visibility
                                    td 1 label
                    .protocol-note
                        span.protocol-note-label Annotation record
                        code { bbox, keypoints[5], ripeness, occlusion }

            section#examples.paper-section
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .section-heading
                        span.section-number 03
                        div
                            p.section-type Qualitative examples
                            h2 Annotation views
                    p.section-summary
                        | The examples below isolate the principal supervision signals. Visual overlays are explanatory and use the same real greenhouse image distributed with this project page.
                    .figure-grid
                        figure.research-figure.example-figure
                            .figure-frame.figure-frame--crop.figure-frame--ripe
                                img(src='assets/strawberry-field.webp', alt='Close crop of ripe strawberries used to illustrate a maturity label', width='1280', height='720', loading='lazy')
                                .figure-code R0
                                .example-box(aria-hidden='true')
                            figcaption
                                span.figure-number Figure 2a.
                                |  Ripeness attribute for a localized fruit instance.
                        figure.research-figure.example-figure
                            .figure-frame.figure-frame--crop.figure-frame--occlusion
                                img(src='assets/strawberry-field.webp', alt='Strawberry and surrounding foliage used to illustrate visibility annotation', width='1280', height='720', loading='lazy')
                                .figure-code O2
                                .visibility-outline(aria-hidden='true')
                            figcaption
                                span.figure-number Figure 2b.
                                |  Occlusion label describing instance visibility.
                        figure.research-figure.example-figure
                            .figure-frame.figure-frame--crop.figure-frame--keypoints
                                img(src='assets/strawberry-field.webp', alt='Strawberry crop with five illustrative keypoint landmarks', width='1280', height='720', loading='lazy')
                                .figure-code K=5
                                span.example-point.example-point--1(aria-hidden='true')
                                span.example-point.example-point--2(aria-hidden='true')
                                span.example-point.example-point--3(aria-hidden='true')
                                span.example-point.example-point--4(aria-hidden='true')
                                span.example-point.example-point--5(aria-hidden='true')
                            figcaption
                                span.figure-number Figure 2c.
                                |  Five landmarks encoding strawberry geometry.

            section#resources.paper-section.paper-section--alt
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .section-heading
                        span.section-number 04
                        div
                            p.section-type Availability
                            h2 Resources
                    .resources-layout
                        .download-record
                            .resource-status
                                span.status-indicator(aria-hidden='true')
                                | Dataset available
                            h3 Strawberry dataset package
                            p The current release is distributed through Baidu Netdisk.
                            a.btn.btn-research(href='https://pan.baidu.com/s/1ul6L7jNT5VSTEdgTZroezA?pwd=pgna', target='_blank', rel='noopener noreferrer') Open dataset download
                            p.access-code Access code: 
                                code pgna
                        .resource-index
                            dl
                                .resource-row
                                    dt Dataset
                                    dd
                                        span.resource-available Available
                                .resource-row
                                    dt Associated paper
                                    dd To be added
                                .resource-row
                                    dt Source code
                                    dd To be added
                                .resource-row
                                    dt Dataset license
                                    dd To be specified
                                .resource-row
                                    dt Citation
                                    dd To be added with publication details

        include includes/footer.pug
        include includes/scripts.pug
